3603 an adaptation of the original five volume arc of the popular jojo s bizarre adventure manga covering the phantom blood chapters jonathan joestar is an aristocratic boy whose life is suddenly turned upside down by a mysterious new boy who arrives dio brando dio has a connection to his father and over time a rivalry forms as dio becomes obsessed with a mysterious ancient and mystical stone mask that jonathan s father keeps
