42892 richard plantagenet has dedicated his whole life to becoming strong enough to fight alongside his father the duke of york together they have waged war to reclaim the right to the throne of england from king henry vi and the house of lancaster however the young richard hides a secret one that his mother scorns him for which the cruel voices in his head never fail to remind him of even amid his personal turmoil he is fortunate to find solace in the light of his father s love but when the war of the roses takes a turn for the bloodier the fervent ambitions of richard grow while his old loyalties splinter threatening to taint his family s path to glory
