38528 after the crisis brought forth by the black order bo city s surviving residents desert the place with nearby cities providing shelter to the displaced refugees mo fan and his family accept the offer and travel to mingzhu city the capital of magic mo fan has little time to settle in when his teacher tang yue requests him to assist her with an investigation involving the black order however mo fan agrees only on the condition of having a dark element awakened in him as he steadily attunes to his newfound powers mo fan prepares to enroll at mingzhu university a dream place for all magicians along the way mo fan s interactions with the elements steadily surpass his expectations showing him that this is only the beginning of discoveries within his limitless potential
57888 after a long time of absence tenbahl s hero rovel vankreift finally returns home from the spirit realm alive but forever changed ten years ago after being grievously wounded due to a massive battle against a horde of monsters he was saved by origin the queen of spirits through her intervention rovel was healed by becoming half spirit and soon after the two were wed from their union ellen was born a brilliant child who inherited her mother s ethereal power and her father s enduring humanity in truth ellen s genius stems from memories of a past life in japan where she once lived as a devoted chemist using her extensive understanding of the periodic table and all elemental permutations she commands the very building blocks of matter itself turning anything into everything she desires unfortunately this means that any revelation of her existence could easily draw the attention of those who may want to exploit her and undoubtedly upend the fragile balance between the human and spirit realms as rovel resumes his duties as a noble ellen gradually becomes exposed to the dangers that lie ahead with her growing powers attracting admiration and malice alike the young reincarnator must learn what it truly means to be the child of two worlds and potentially be the catalyst toward uniting both
57969 the tropical seiren island is a paradise for deviants the infamous pervert law grants near complete sexual freedom with almost no taboos or boundaries with its various suggestive attractions the seirantou health organization sho entices visitors while providing regular medical checks and contraceptive pills to ensure carefree enjoyment however for high school student junnosuke tachibana the island is far from ideal having recently moved there with his younger sister asane he cannot stand the empty loveless sexual acts to make matters worse junnosuke s abstinence attracts unwanted attention and those who defy the law face punishment junnosuke soon crosses paths with nanase katagiri a notorious island seductress surprisingly instead of forcing herself on him she helps him flee from the sho together they discover a secret group that exists for a singular goal to destroy the sho now equipped with a way to resist the unjust rules junnosuke and other kindred spirits set out to crush the pervert law
