419 in the year 1600 at the fog covered battlefield of sekigahara a fierce battle was waged by two exemplary swordsmen one was kyoushirou mibu a skilled and noble warrior in possession of the unique powers of the mibu clan the other was the thousand man slayer with eyes and hair the color of blood demon eyes kyou their legendary clash was cut short when a meteor from the heavens fell down upon that battlefield leaving both to vanish in its wake samurai deeper kyou begins four years after that battle when a gun wielding bounty hunter by the name of yuya shiina hunts down kyoushirou now a perverted traveling medicine man who has built up a large debt on her way to claim his bounty they are attacked by an inhuman monster that seeks to devour kyoushirou this encounter awakens demon eyes kyou whose mind has been trapped inside of kyoushirou s body ever since that fateful battle thus begins a grand tale of legendary two swordsmen and the discovery of their secrets
